Optional `source_identity` records a stable repository namespace and document ID, independent of title and checkout location. Legacy location-only ownership requires verified migration. `source_record` preserves an imported document's provider id, declared status, authored source revision and declared `superseded_by` value. Archived or superseded means historical scope, not falsehood. Missing metadata means unknown; a successor value is not an automatically resolved vault link. Status changes invalidate semantic inputs.

`document_type` values: `note` | `report` | `data` (FORMAT only; subject-matter goes in `tags`).

